+6. integration-test fixture and concurrency-test conventions.
+
+### Performance Optimization Guide
+
+| Performance Target | Technique | Existing Infrastructure | Validation | Tasks |
+|--------------------|-----------|-------------------------|------------|-------|
+| No overspend under concurrent starts | Conditional debit guarded by `available_credits > 0` in a transaction | Not present in workspace | Parallel-start integration test | Assign during `/story-tasks` |
+| One effect per terminal outcome | Guard transition on `state = reserved` and unique idempotency key | Not present in workspace | Duplicate callback/cancellation tests | Assign during `/story-tasks` |
+| No stranded charge after provider failure | Transition and re-credit in one transaction | Not present in workspace | Failure/timeout/crash-boundary tests | Assign during `/story-tasks` |
+
